OL,3,AOdyssey painting goes on show at city
OL,4,Aart gallery
OL,5,
OL,6,FA famous painting depicting a scene
OL,7,Ffrom Homer's Odyssey has gone on
OL,8,Fdisplay at York Art Gallery.
OL,10,FThe J.M.W. Turner creation, on loan
OL,11,Ffrom the National Gallery and forming
OL,12,Fpart of a new exhibition, shows
OL,13,FUlysses, also known as Odysseus,
OL,14,Fsailing from the island where
OL,15,FPolyphemus, a one-eyed giant, had held
OL,16,Fhim and his men captive.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
