OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AOdyssey painting goes on show at city
OL,4,Aart gallery
OL,5,
OL,6,FFollowing the recent success of the new
OL,7,FChristopher Nolan film based on the
OL,8,Fepic poem, curators said they hoped
OL,9,Fthere would be renewed interest in
OL,10,Fartists' interpretations of Homer's
OL,11,Fwork.
OL,13,FThe painting is one of more than 100
OL,14,Fworks to go on display as part of
OL,15,FTurner, Wedgwood & Beyond: Inspired by
OL,16,FFlaxman, which opens at the gallery on
OL,17,FFriday.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
